# RR2f-2 (critical_qualifier_receivers_bug; steps/qualifier-receivers-20261010.md): `const` over an anonymous
# construction protects the binding: the later `a: b` is refused at the statement, as it is for a qualified merge
# result (unit_rr2_qualified_merge_const_refused).
fn: m () int
    a: const: (int: v 7)
    b: immutable: (int: v 8)
    a: b
    return: a\v
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
